ground\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.30<br/>December 11, 2013<br/>Winter Update 2013</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Roshamuul Mines</b> are a small mine infested with <a href=\"#/wiki/Terrorsleep\">Terrorsleeps</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Feversleep\">Feversleeps</a>.\n</p><p>Hunting here is strongly discouraged because the Dreamhaunter inhabiting the mines are really unattractive and annoying to hunt.\n</p><p>Some of the <a href=\"#/quest/roshamuul-quest\">Roshamuul Quest</a> takes place here.\n</p></div>","quests":["roshamuul-quest"]}